# Exclude test fixtures from FlagShark scans.
#
# The tree-sitter and regex detector fixtures contain real-looking SDK calls
# (e.g. `ld.variation("checkout-redesign")`, `posthog.isFeatureEnabled(...)`)
# used to verify the detectors work. When the public OSS scoreboard scans
# this repo, those fixtures would otherwise be reported as ~50 stale flags
# and drown out any real signal.
packages/core/test/fixtures/**
packages/*/test/fixtures/**
packages/*/__fixtures__/**
